format session-log-v1
stamp 20260820.072552
editor Claude Code
model claude-opus-5
voice Kyri
host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan tidings -- the reader who raised a quarrel is told how it came out
prompt Kyri first, then REMEMBER and the road-ahead itineraries; Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; council rota one doc; condense REMEMBER when a set closes; send each finished increment
think Standfast first. Every living row in crux/REDS.md reads closed -- 96 and 97 closed this morning, 81 - 83 - 84 - 85 closed before them, rows 1-95 folded to archive/. No open agent-closable red stood in the way, so the constructive queue was clear to open.
think The running thread came from the newest log's recommend, which named its own open question exactly: every finding of this arc travels to the place a word is read, and nothing has ever gone back to the person who raised the quarrel to tell them how it came out. That is a whole rung, and it is the crux -- the arc has spent seven rungs learning to correct a record and never once reported back to the one person who asked it to.
think Council rota, lap index 66 mod 27 = 12: deep-read active-designing/20260618-184912_growing-a-language.md. Two of its five moves governed this lap directly. Diverge by strengthening rather than rewriting -- so the rung was grown as a delegating tier over repose.rye, every elder fold re-exported unchanged and only the new question local. And the parity gate is the specification -- here the measurement was: naming the number the two runs must disagree on told me exactly how large this rung had to be, and nothing larger.
think The name came from the Comlink tendency -- clear, fun, safe. `tidings` is plain English for news carried back to somebody waiting for it, greps clean across the whole tree, and reads warm on the thousandth typing. Two bytes chosen fresh: `m` and `t`, since the reading already rides as `s`, the term as `r` and `l`, and the standing as `h` and `q`.
think The first lap run disagreed with my design, and the wire was right. I had expected the answer `moved` -- the repair moves the plan's word, so surely the objection carried. Reading the record straight says otherwise: this reader took away `borne`, objected after the correction to `carried`, and `carried` is exactly what the plan finally settled. Their objection moved nothing. So the lap sends `t`, the uncomfortable answer, and that is the honest one -- a rung that only ever told people good news would be worth nothing to them. The `moved` answer moved to its own wire proof, written to a reader of its own and read back out of their box.
obs A tiding reports and never argues. It grades no objection and names no winner; it reads the word the reader stood against and the word the plan settled, and says whether they are the same. That restraint is what keeps the note honest -- a run that scored its own quarrels would be marking its own paper at the one place a person reads.
obs The five RED paths were proven on metal before the claim, and the planted control is the one that matters: with the letter never sent, the read-back skipped, the fold disarmed, and the harness read that catches them all removed, the selftest still calls itself GREEN while `caravan/.readers/desk.outof` is absent from the raiser's box entirely -- beside a `desk.told`, a `desk.again`, and a `desk.still` that all arrived. Seeing that once is what makes the writing back a check rather than decoration.
obs Registered in the choir the same round, per REDS %81's lesson -- a rung that lands as its own green witness and never joins the suite is a loom firing unheard.
loom witness=caravan_tidings_witness result=GREEN phases=6 dependents=6 absorbed=3 lost=3 reseated=3 told=1 unreturned_before=1 unreturned_after=0
loom suite=caravan_suite_witness rungs=67 result=GREEN
file caravan/tidings.rye the rung -- a run writes the outcome of a quarrel into the box of the person who raised it, with four refusals by name
file tools/caravan_tidings_witness.rish the witness on metal -- the measurement, both answers on the wire, and the five RED paths recorded
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung, so the choir sings 67 in one voice
file caravan/README.md the durable record of the rung, its refusals, and its numbers
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge refilled; the repose rung condensed to a pointer so the card stays single-stranded
recommend keep-going the arc has now corrected a record, carried the correction where it is read, heard the answer, recorded the disagreement, escorted the word, bounded the objection, stood its standing in the mark, and finally written back to the person who raised it -- so the question above it is what a run owes a reader who is told the word stood: nothing in this arc lets that person appeal, and an answer with no way to answer it back is a door that only opens outward.
